# Guards whose falsification receipt does not yet say how to score it again.
#
# A guard that cannot be re-validated quickly is defective on its own terms: it claims to
# catch something and records no way to check that claim a second time.  The four fields a
# receipt owes, and the failure each was earned from, are in
# `scripts/falsify-review.py` and doc/claude/TESTING.md.
#
